{"Title":"An Act authorizing an extended term of agreement between the town of Foxborough and the town of Sharon for municipal sewer service ","BillNumber":"H4754","DocketNumber":"HD5132","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-20T12:23:14.21"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-20T12:23:14.21"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4754/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Barrows of Mansfield, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of F. Jay Barrows relative to authorizing an extended term of agreement between the town of Foxborough and the town of Sharon for municipal sewer service.  Municipalities and Regional Government.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1. Notwithstanding section 4A of chapter 40 or section 1 of chapter 83 of the General Laws, or any other general or special law to the contrary, the Town of Foxborough and the Town of Sharon, acting by or through their select boards, are authorized to amend the agreement dated Augst 1, 2023, between the towns of Foxborough and Sharon relative to the providing of municipal sewer service in Sharon, and extended the term of the agreement to a term not more than 99 years.\r\n\tSection 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}